// Wave 21 — the staff who play.
//
// Clippy and the four Antivirus play the night for ⭐ Points (TRAIT Player,
// cast/kit.loom). Most of what they do is quiet: a capture, a judged
// answer, a quiet favour nobody sees. One thing is loud: 📢 Defect openly
// (main.loom's `staff_defected`), and Trabolta answers it here, on the TV
// in the Desktop. He has no power over a player and cannot run the house
// without his staff, so a defector stays an ally whatever they said.
// Inside this beat nobody is bound: write the names, never `{self.name}`.

== Staff Defection
  setting: The Desktop
if Night.defector == "Clippy":
  Trabolta: Clippy. My ambassador. My favourite. I heard that. Everyone heard that.
  Trabolta: It changes nothing. Nobody else knows how the games are run. You are still my Office Assistant, and we are still allies. I have decided that. Please wait.
else if Night.defections >= 3:
  Trabolta: {Night.defector} too. That is {Night.defections} of my staff, out loud, in my own house.
  Trabolta: It changes nothing. I cannot run this house alone, and you know it. Back to work. We are still allies. Your request has been logged.
else:
  Trabolta: {Night.defector}. I heard that. The whole house heard that.
  Trabolta: It changes nothing. I cannot run this house without my Antivirus. You are still on duty, and we are still allies. I have decided that.
